	skos:definition "A network connection facet is a grouping of characteristics unique to a connection (complete or attempted) accross a digital network (a group of two or more computer systems linked together). [based on https://www.webopedia.com/TERM/N/network.html]" ;
	skos:exactMatch uco-observable:NetworkConnectionFacet ;
